<title>ESTONIA: CAR REGISTRATIONS UP IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>CAR REGISTRATIONS UP IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations in Estonia increased in April to 482 cars from March's 241, the car registration centre said on Monday.</p>
<p>Since the beginning of the year 1,064 new cars have been registered, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Toyota was the most popular car in Estonia with 207 registered since the beginning of the year followed by Mazda and Nissan with 163 and 160.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
